    "answer": {
      "short": "Mean $=50.42$ (to two decimal places); median $=58$.",
      "worked": "The plot represents 19 values, with stems giving tens and leaves giving units.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\text{Sum}&=12+24+27+32+34+42+42+52+52+58+58+63+64+64+65+65+67+68+69\\\\\n\\text{Sum}&=958\\\\\n\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{958}{19}\\\\\n\\text{Mean}&\\approx50.42\n\\end{align*}$$\nThe median is the $\\frac{19+1}{2}=10$th value in order. The 10th value is 58, so the median is $58$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
